OL,3,GNEWSAHospital must make immediate fire
OL,4,Asafety changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has been told it must make
OL,7,Fchanges "immediately" to improve its
OL,8,Ffire safety measures following an
OL,9,Finspection in July.
OL,11,FTorbay and South Devon NHS Foundation
OL,12,FTrust was issued an enforcement notice
OL,13,Fby the fire service in relation to
OL,14,Ffloors four to eight of Torbay
OL,15,FHospital's Tower Block.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
