OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital must make immediate fire
OL,4,Asafety changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Somerset Fire Service said
OL,7,Fchanges were needed to provide
OL,8,F"sufficient escape routes for people in
OL,9,Fthe event of a fire," stressing these
OL,10,Fmust be made by 6 November. The Care
OL,11,FQuality Commission has also inspected
OL,12,Fthe building and issued a warning
OL,13,Fnotice.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the hospital trust
OL,16,Fsaid it was "fully committed to meeting
OL,17,Fthe requirements of the notice".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
